Provides support for Post creation and list users posts.

---

## Queries

In order to list user's posts you must provide an `Authorization` token.

```graphql
query {
  posts {
    posts {
      edges {
        node {
          id
          content
          author {
            id
            username
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Mutations

In order to create a new Post, you must provide an authorization token as well.

```graphql
mutation ($content: String!) {
  postCreate(content: $content) {
    post {
      id
      content
      author {
        id
        username
      }
    }
  }
}
```
